('P5DAT04-D01','P5-DAT-04','diagnostic','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-04','easy','mcq','In a histogram, the class 20 ≤ x < 30 has frequency 40. What should its frequency density be?','["4", "40", "0.25", "400"]','A','Class width is 10, so frequency density = frequency ÷ class width = 40 ÷ 10 = 4.','В гистограмме интервал 20 ≤ x < 30 имеет частоту 40. Чему должна быть равна плотность частоты?','Gistogrammada 20 ≤ x < 30 intervalining chastotasi 40. Uning chastota zichligi nechaga teng?','In a histogram, the class 20 ≤ x < 30 has frequency 40. What should its frequency density be?','["4", "40", "0.25", "400"]','["4", "40", "0.25", "400"]','["4", "40", "0.25", "400"]','Ширина интервала равна 10, поэтому плотность частоты = частота ÷ ширина интервала = 40 ÷ 10 = 4.','Interval kengligi 10, shuning uchun chastota zichligi = chastota ÷ interval kengligi = 40 ÷ 10 = 4.','Class width is 10, so frequency density = frequency ÷ class width = 40 ÷ 10 = 4.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT04-D01',55,''),
