('P5DAT04-L02','P5-DAT-04','learning','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-04','medium','input','A histogram bar has class width 4 and frequency density 7. Enter the frequency represented by the bar.','[]','28','Frequency = frequency density × class width = 7 × 4 = 28.','Столбец гистограммы имеет ширину интервала 4 и плотность частоты 7. Введите частоту, которую представляет столбец.','Gistogramma ustunining interval kengligi 4 va chastota zichligi 7. Ustun ifodalagan chastotani kiriting.','A histogram bar has class width 4 and frequency density 7. Enter the frequency represented by the bar.','[]','[]','[]','Частота = плотность частоты × ширина интервала = 7 × 4 = 28.','Chastota = chastota zichligi × interval kengligi = 7 × 4 = 28.','Frequency = frequency density × class width = 7 × 4 = 28.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT04-L02',55,''),
('P5DAT04-L03','P5-DAT-04','learning','P5 Representation of data','P5-DAT-04','medium','mcq','A histogram has class 0 ≤ x < 2 with frequency 8 and class 2 ≤ x < 8 with frequency 24. Which statement about the two bar heights is correct?','["The bars have equal height", "The first bar is twice as high", "The second bar is twice as high", "The second bar is three times as high"]','A','The densities are 8/2 = 4 and 24/6 = 4, so the two bar heights are equal.','В гистограмме интервал 0 ≤ x < 2 имеет частоту 8, а интервал 2 ≤ x < 8 — частоту 24. Какое утверждение о высотах двух столбцов верно?','Gistogrammada 0 ≤ x < 2 intervalining chastotasi 8, 2 ≤ x < 8 intervalining chastotasi 24. Ikki ustun balandligi haqida qaysi fikr to‘g‘ri?','A histogram has class 0 ≤ x < 2 with frequency 8 and class 2 ≤ x < 8 with frequency 24. Which statement about the two bar heights is correct?','["The bars have equal height", "The first bar is twice as high", "The second bar is twice as high", "The second bar is three times as high"]','["The bars have equal height", "The first bar is twice as high", "The second bar is twice as high", "The second bar is three times as high"]','["The bars have equal height", "The first bar is twice as high", "The second bar is twice as high", "The second bar is three times as high"]','Плотности равны 8/2 = 4 и 24/6 = 4, поэтому высоты столбцов одинаковы.','Zichliklar 8/2 = 4 va 24/6 = 4, shuning uchun ikki ustun balandligi teng.','The densities are 8/2 = 4 and 24/6 = 4, so the two bar heights are equal.','ExamPrep:P5:p5_repr_beta_v1:P5DAT04-L03',65,''),
